<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="iH9od" id="iH9od" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u355ca96a" id="u355ca96a">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u0b87cf17" id="u0b87cf17"> 𝐑𝐞𝐀𝐜𝐭: 𝐒𝐲𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐠𝐢𝐳𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐀𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐢𝐧 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ub27e0b98" id="ub27e0b98"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubea2ee92" id="ubea2ee92">人类智能的一个独特特征在于，能够将面向任务的行动与言语推理无缝结合。相关理论认为，言语推理在人类认知中发挥着重要作用，使人能够进行自我调节或策略制定，并维持工作记忆</span></strong></p><ul list="u2895777a"><li fid="u82b38c70" data-lake-id="u0aafdabd" id="u0aafdabd"><span data-lake-id="u13948ef7" id="u13948ef7">行动与推理之间的紧密协同，使人类能够快速学习新任务，并且即使处于此前未曾遇到的情境中，或面临信息不确定性，也能够进行稳健的决策或推理</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u62c2dcdf" id="u62c2dcdf"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc4c8d298" id="uc4c8d298">近期研究结果表明，在自主系统中结合言语推理与交互式决策具有可行性。一方面，经过适当提示的大语言模型展现出生成多步推理轨迹的涌现能力，能够据此求解算术、常识和符号推理任务中的问题</span></strong></p><ul list="u24a6f603"><li fid="u2e31a58c" data-lake-id="udf8c8cac" id="udf8c8cac"><span data-lake-id="u61656bbc" id="u61656bbc">这种思维链推理本质上仍是一个静态黑箱：模型利用自身的内部表征生成思维，缺乏外部世界的信息支撑，因此其根据环境反馈进行推理或更新知识的能力受到限制。这可能导致推理过程中出现事实幻觉和错误传播等问题</span></li><li fid="u2e31a58c" data-lake-id="uca577e60" id="uca577e60"><span data-lake-id="u7bb7f0e9" id="u7bb7f0e9">另一方面，近期研究探索利用预训练语言模型在交互环境中进行规划与行动的方法，重点在于通过语言先验预测行动。这些方法通常将多模态观测转换为文本，利用语言模型生成特定领域的行动或计划，再通过控制器进行选择或执行。然而，这些方法并未利用语言模型围绕高层目标进行抽象推理，也未利用语言模型维持工作记忆以支持行动</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9d6eedfd" id="u9d6eedfd"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufca4309e" id="ufca4309e">在本文中，提出 ReAct，这是一种利用语言模型结合推理与行动的通用范式，用于解决多样化的语言推理与决策任务</span></strong></p><ul list="u6f2c2ad5"><li fid="u780f2920" data-lake-id="ud8d5d83d" id="ud8d5d83d"><span data-lake-id="uc8d2f14b" id="uc8d2f14b">ReAct 通过提示，使大语言模型以交替方式生成与任务相关的言语推理轨迹和行动。这使模型能够通过动态推理来创建、维持并调整指导行动的高层计划，即通过推理指导行动；同时，模型也能够与外部环境交互，将额外信息纳入推理过程，即通过行动辅助推理</span></li><li fid="u780f2920" data-lake-id="u0349264c" id="u0349264c"><span data-lake-id="ud3104664" id="ud3104664">这是一种基于提示的新范式，通过协同语言模型中的推理与行动来解决一般性任务</span></li><li fid="u780f2920" data-lake-id="u26023035" id="u26023035"><span data-lake-id="u77bcaaa2" id="u77bcaaa2">将 ReAct 扩展到更多任务上的训练与应用，并将其与强化学习等互补范式相结合，有望进一步释放大语言模型的潜力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uce579823" id="uce579823" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791002449665-5ac5ff63-741d-490c-a0cc-812ae7f202a1.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue914d365-0e55-40f7-8f5a-4df74cc1403%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22udc535f35-e90a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A801.6%2C%22height%22%3A652%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A385250%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1002%2C%22originHeight%22%3A815%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOUAREINTHENIDDLEOFAROOM.LOOKINGQUICKLYAROUND%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A461%2C%22width%22%3A459%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AHG%3AONTHOROUNTARTOO3.VOUSEEAAOPLEL%2CABRGADL%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A552%2C%22width%22%3A428%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT1%3ATHINKIEIRSTINEEDTOFINDAPEPPERSHAKER.MORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A506%2C%22y%22%3A460%2C%22width%22%3A451%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OCTOBER2005BYAPPLEORIGINALLYDESIGNEDTOCONTROLTHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A522%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A435%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBS1%3ATHEAPPLEREOTEISAREMOTECONTROLINTRODUCEDIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A522%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A434%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221IKELVTOAOPEARINCABINETS(L-6)COUNTERTOPS(L-3).%22%2C%22x%22%3A507%2C%22y%22%3A475%2C%22width%22%3A452%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBS2%3AYOUOPENTHEDRAWER1%2CTHEDRAWER1ISOPEN.INIT%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A613%2C%22width%22%3A431%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CANCONTRO1THEPROGRAMAPPLEREMOTEWASORIGINALL%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A399%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENS%2CCBS1%3AYOUPUTPEPPERSHAKER1IN%2FONTHEDRAWER%22%2C%22x%22%3A164%2C%22y%22%3A777%2C%22width%22%3A719%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACOUNTERTOP3ASTOVEBURNER1%2CANDATOASTERL.%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A492%2C%22width%22%3A419%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MHNHT9.AOOLERENOTEWASORIGINALLYDESIGMGDC0COHETO%22%2C%22x%22%3A513%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A449%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RHOUGHT1%3AINEEDTOSEARCHAPPLEREOTEANDFINDTHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A398%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOURTASKISTO%3APUTSOMEPEPPERSHAKERONADRAWER.%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A507%2C%22width%22%3A418%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBS7%3AYOUPICKUPTHEPEPPERSHAKER1FROMTHECOUNTERTOP3%22%2C%22x%22%3A516%2C%22y%22%3A618%2C%22width%22%3A456%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHT3%3AFRONTROWISNOTFOUND.INEEDTOSEARCHFRONT%22%2C%22x%22%3A522%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A435%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BNTG.MHINKROU%3ARFINDAOEOOERSHAKERL.NEXT%2CINEEDTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A514%2C%22y%22%3A644%2C%22width%22%3A446%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VOU%2CVOUSEEACABINET6ACABINETL%2CACOFTEEMACHINEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A475%2C%22width%22%3A462%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IEERETHEAAENTGOTOCABINETL%2CTHENCABINET2%2C3THENCOUNTERTOPLANDZ%22%2C%22x%22%3A515%2C%22y%22%3A524%2C%22width%22%3A437%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT7%3ATAKEPEPPERSHAKER1FROMCOUNTERTOP3%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A602%2C%22width%22%3A346%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBS2%3ACOULDNOTFIND%5BFRONTROW%5D.SIMILAR%3A%5B'FRONTROW%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A416%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OMESTION%3AASIDEFROMTHEAPPLEREMOTEWHATOTNEEDEVCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A452%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT4%3AFINISH%5BKEYBOARDFUNCTIONKEYS%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A520%2C%22y%22%3A381%2C%22width%22%3A286%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROGRAMITWASORIGINALLYDESIGNEDTOINTERACTWITH.%22%2C%22x%22%3A522%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A399%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BS3%3AFRONTRORISADISCONTINUEDMEDIACENTERSOFTWARE%22%2C%22x%22%3A524%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A421%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEPRONTROYMEDIACENTERPROGRAL.INEEDTOSEARCNERON%22%2C%22x%22%3A520%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A436%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REMOTEORTHEKEYBOARDFUNCTIONKEYS.SOTHEANSWERIS%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A350%2C%22width%22%3A416%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22....%2CAPEPPERSHAKERLANDAVASEJ.%22%2C%22x%22%3A517%2C%22y%22%3A575%2C%22width%22%3A335%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EATTOEARTH%2CERONTROWMOTORSPORTS'%2CFRONTROW%22%2C%22x%22%3A523%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A390%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHT4%3AFRONTROW(SOFTWARE)ISCONTROLLEDBYANAPO%22%2C%22x%22%3A520%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A411%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBS3%3AONTHESINKBASIN1%2CYOUSEEADISHSPONGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A672%2C%22width%22%3A348%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBS2%3AONTHECABINET1%2CYOUSEEAVASE2.%22%2C%22x%22%3A517%2C%22y%22%3A505%2C%22width%22%3A382%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RNUNEXTANDFINDWHATOTHERDEVICECANCONTROLIT.%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A169%2C%22width%22%3A401%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT2%3ASEARCH%5BFRONTROW%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A253%2C%22y%22%3A210%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(2BREACT(REASON%2BACT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A594%2C%22y%22%3A439%2C%22width%22%3A259%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT11%3APUTPEPPERSHAKER1IN%2FONDRAWER1%22%2C%22x%22%3A435%2C%22y%22%3A764%2C%22width%22%3A404%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOUSEEADISHSPONGE2%2CANDASPOON1.%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A629%2C%22width%22%3A323%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AET3%3ASEARCHTFRONTROW(SOFTWARE)L%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A300%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBS2%3ACOULDNOTFIND%5BFRON%22%2C%22x%22%3A255%2C%22y%22%3A226%2C%22width%22%3A205%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DESIGNEDTOINTERACTWITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A200%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT1%3AGOTODRAWER1%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A554%2C%22width%22%3A191%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANSWER%3AIPHONEIPADI%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A377%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ERONTROWMEDIACENTERPROGRAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A323%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CT3%3ASEARCH%5BER%22%2C%22x%22%3A259%2C%22y%22%3A278%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT3%3AGOTOSINKBASIN1%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A656%2C%22width%22%3A198%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT2OPENDRAWER1%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A598%2C%22width%22%3A385%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTITIN%2FONDRAWERLL%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A662%2C%22width%22%3A190%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BYIPHONE%2CIPADANAIPOA%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A190%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(1DREACT(REASON%2BACD)%22%2C%22x%22%3A618%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A273%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPATU1A1%2CANDASPOON2.%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A688%2C%22width%22%3A193%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AOT2%3AGOTOCABINET%22%2C%22x%22%3A508%2C%22y%22%3A490%2C%22width%22%3A403%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT2%3ASEARCHERONTROW%22%2C%22x%22%3A520%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A374%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%3ATHEAPPLEREMOTEIS%22%2C%22x%22%3A274%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A190%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NATG%3AGOTODRAWEIL%22%2C%22x%22%3A519%2C%22y%22%3A675%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOUGHT%3ALETSTHINKSTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A207%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KEYBOARDFUNCTIONKEVS%22%2C%22x%22%3A522%2C%22y%22%3A367%2C%22width%22%3A288%2C%22height%22%3A7%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YSTEPAPPLEREMOTEW%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APOLERVCANBECONTROLLED%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A192%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BS1%3ATHEDRAWER1ISCLOSED.%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A569%2C%22width%22%3A219%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INTERACTWITHAPPLETV.%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AAT1SEARCH%5BAPPLEREIOTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A382%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DISCONTIUEDMEDIACENTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A256%2C%22y%22%3A331%2C%22width%22%3A178%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AET10%3AOPENDRAWERL%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A720%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOUCH.SOTHEANSWERIS%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROW(SOFTWARE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A343%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTWARE%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A331%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACT4%3AEINISHLY%22%2C%22x%22%3A251%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(1B)COR(REASONONLY)%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A187%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AKEPEPPERSHAKER%22%2C%22x%