ong><span data-lake-id="u49d0fac1" id="u49d0fac1">考虑智能体通过与环境交互来解决任务的一般设置。在时间步</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i2TPq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc64ebc66" id="uc64ebc66">，智能体从环境中接收观测</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22o_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ead35caa49cb1d1733c96224df38d7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LG89z%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u23476dc9" id="u23476dc9">，并按照某个策略</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(a_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20c_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff05adbb55b11cd1bd261f765b3c94241.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CiIoF%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3209a315" id="u3209a315">采取行动</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BA%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa1b851e3e4dd7635fdd7ccde1106ac43.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KJfmy%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0fc7658a" id="u0fc7658a">，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_t%20%3D%20(o_1%2C%20a_1%2C%20%5C%5Ccdots%2C%20o_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20a_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20o_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd081ad1a7fab4a1cca1ffcceaaa1771.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YL6at%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4fc2554a" id="u4fc2554a"> 表示智能体的上下文。当映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_t%20%5C%5Cmapsto%20a_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81bea26cc89b895fecb41d218393e5dc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uGwrh%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue025d0d2" id="ue025d0d2">具有较强的隐含性，且需要大量计算时，策略学习便具有挑战性</span></strong></p><ul list="u29e67b67"><li fid="ua6d151eb" data-lake-id="uee901e41" id="uee901e41"><span data-lake-id="u5c2aba11" id="u5c2aba11">ReAct 的核心思想十分简单：将智能体的行动空间扩展为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BA%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BA%7D%20%5C%5Ccup%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b95c26ec32222a301891343401b0f7d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cUCXc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4114eef6" id="u4114eef6">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b4abab2d4d67001988fb0235d36fcd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V4kAo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7da5c844" id="u7da5c844">表示语言空间。语言空间中的行动</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Ba%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe5aac21db53aa7a9ecc27c8d49066c3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22roTZG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f8f80f8" id="u5f8f80f8">被称为思维或推理轨迹，它不会影响外部环境，因此也不会产生观测反馈</span></li><li fid="ua6d151eb" data-lake-id="uff61bc8c" id="uff61bc8c"><span data-lake-id="uec90329b" id="uec90329b">相反，思维</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Ba%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8d5034539339cf61412d9c5cc85f4b6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aZi1p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b228837" id="u2b228837">旨在通过对当前上下文</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa181e1c7043c70d626a61a1bc0ebc218.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J1K2t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u639a51ed" id="u639a51ed">进行推理来组织有用的信息，并将上下文更新为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7Bt%2B1%7D%20%3D%20(c_t%2C%20%5C%5Chat%7Ba%7D_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F989bdc5f467d600702f7e5c5c4cbc927.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wVoKD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc322f32a" id="uc322f32a">，以支持后续推理或行动</span></li><li fid="ua6d151eb" data-lake-id="u8a2ca733" id="u8a2ca733"><span data-lake-id="ueb021e5d" id="ueb021e5d">有用的思维可以具有多种形式：分解任务目标并制定行动计划；引入与任务求解相关的常识知识；从观测中提取重要信息；跟踪进展并切换行动计划；处理异常情况并调整行动计划等</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc16f6477" id="uc16f6477"><span data-lake-id="u92f6b9d1" id="u92f6b9d1">对于以推理为主的任务，交替生成思维与行动，使任务求解轨迹由多个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf6a21e87" id="uf6a21e87" style="color: #DF2A3F">思维—行动—观测步骤构成</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufb0313b9" id="ufb0313b9">。相比之下，对于可能涉及大量行动的决策任务，思维只需稀疏地出现在轨迹中最相关的位置，因此让语言模型自行决定思维与行动各自出现的时机。由于将决策能力与推理能力整合到同一个大语言模型中，ReAct 具有以下几项独特性质</span></p><ul list="u16161f34"><li fid="u3c8c387c" data-lake-id="u5156ba80" id="u5156ba80"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9447739e" id="u9447739e">直观且易于设计：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubbf469e5" id="ubbf469e5">人工标注者只需在所采取的行动基础上，用语言写下自己的思维</span></li><li fid="u3c8c387c" data-lake-id="u29103b3f" id="u29103b3f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u19830295" id="u19830295">通用且灵活：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u538b3a8f" id="u538b3a8f">得益于灵活的思维空间，以及思维与行动的灵活组织形式，ReAct 能够适用于行动空间和推理需求各不相同的多种任务，包括但不限于问答、事实核验、文本游戏和网页导航</span></li><li fid="u3c8c387c" data-lake-id="uc158b2c3" id="uc158b2c3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u956a9c96" id="u956a9c96">性能优良且稳健：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2dbc896c" id="u2dbc896c">ReAct 仅通过 1～6 个上下文示例进行学习，就能对新的任务实例展现出较强的泛化能力，并在不同领域中持续优于仅进行推理或仅采取行动的基线方法</span></li><li fid="u3c8c387c" data-lake-id="u9a53be52" id="u9a53be52"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4960d38b" id="u4960d38b">与人类对齐且可控：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7d2fe6be" id="u7d2fe6be">ReAct 能够提供可解释的序贯决策与推理过程，使人类可以方便地检查推理与事实的正确性。此外，人类还可以通过编辑思维内容，在运行过程中控制或纠正智能体的行为</span></li></ul>